{
  "_comment": "ip-rotator v3.1.0 CONTAINER config (run.sh mounts this over /app/config.json). Frontends bind 0.0.0.0 so rootless podman can publish the ports (works since the B37 fix); wg configs dir + wireproxy binary pinned to in-container paths. static_proxies = your 10 Webshare proxies (verified 10/10 live, credentials preserved). Edit freely - no rebuild needed. Full field docs: app/docs/07-config.md",
